{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0039-s002", "text": "Den grundläggande utbildningen är avgiftsfri för familjerna, eftersom den bekostas med skattemedel.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T020938774882+0000-2/hb-c08-u0039-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.428843537414966, "peak": 0.27984619140625, "generation_seconds": 12.283669095020741, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0039-s003", "text": "Också alla läroböcker, läromedel och hjälpmedel är avgiftsfria.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T020938774882+0000-2/hb-c08-u0039-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.921088435374149, "peak": 0.340576171875, "generation_seconds": 9.146436895942315, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0040-s001", "text": "Enligt lagen har eleverna också rätt till avgiftsfria tjänster inom elevhälsa.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T020938774882+0000-2/hb-c08-u0040-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.896326530612245, "peak": 0.2646484375, "generation_seconds": 9.604729995131493, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0040-s002", "text": "Elevhälsan omfattar till exempel tjänster av en skolhälsovårdare, psykolog och kurator.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T020938774882+0000-2/hb-c08-u0040-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.080544217687075, "peak": 0.29083251953125, "generation_seconds": 9.209192398004234, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0040-s003", "text": "Dessa tjänster är tillgängliga under skoldagen i skolan eller närheten av den.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T020938774882+0000-2/hb-c08-u0040-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.896326530612245, "peak": 0.299407958984375, "generation_seconds": 7.669028230011463, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0041-s001", "text": "Syftet med den grundläggande utbildningen är bland annat att", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T020938774882+0000-2/hb-c08-u0041-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.363809523809524, "peak": 0.2904052734375, "generation_seconds": 8.192707008915022, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0042-s001", "text": "ge barnen en allmänbildande utbildning", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T020938774882+0000-2/hb-c08-u0042-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.5526530612244898, "peak": 0.4403076171875, "generation_seconds": 5.283606337849051, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
